ID 3) and there were already /dev/rrz19a - rrz19h and /dev/rz19a - rz19h
device files created when another disk was temporarily added but later
removed.

scsimgr -scan_all found these device files but didn't appear to find the
CD-RW drive. I removed the rrz19* and rz19* files and ran scsimgr -scan_all
again but it didn't create the device files. MAKEDEV reports 'unknown
device in: rrz19' when I try to create the files with /dev/MAKEDEV rrz19.

I don't know if this is relevant but the 8-bit SCSI 2 CD-RW drive with
