To force your computer to stop at the SRM prompt, instead of going through 
the normal boot process:
    	Unplug your hard drive.  Then you can change settings, shutdown,     
	reconnect the hard drive, and come back up to srm prompt.
If you would like to stop at srm in the future, do this:
    	>>> set auto_action halt
To go back to regular:
    	>>> set auto_action boot


