I'm sitting at home with no docs on Exceed so I'm going to take a couple
of guesses.

The error "Fatal error: XDM session declined." might mean that the
Display Server (Exceed) and the Host Client (the Tru64 box) are set in
conflicting "modes".  Either they both have to be set up for XDMCP Query
or Indirect mode.

The Security settings are also very important.  You want "Disabled ..."
and "Allow Host ..." both checked.

If course you can go to www.x.org and download the whole X11R6.5.1
package and review the documentation on XDM (which is very well written)
and it will explain EXACTLY why you are getting that error message !!

Jack Patteeuw


